        "name": "Elite Dracomancer",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your draconic power equals that of a lesser dragon. Choose one 3rd-rank spell and one 4th-rank spell from those listed for a dragon spellcaster of your draconic benefactor's type (for example, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Clairvoyance] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Paralyze] for a conspirator dragon benefactor). You can cast each of these spells once per day as innate spells of the same tradition as your draconic benefactor.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 13
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Dracomancer"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Draconic Codex"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "kobold"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 13,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "imperial-dragon-potion.json",
      "id": "BoLeT3uNl7iikQuI",
      "name": "Imperial Dragon Potion",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "BoLeT3uNl7iikQuI",
        "folder": "cXfmpyLQnPNLWBC7",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Imperial Dragon Potion",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>During your daily preparations, you can spend 10 minutes to create a variant <em>energy breath potion</em>, which has the kobold trait in addition to its normal traits. The variant potion is influenced by imperial dragon magic, granting it the effect corresponding to your dragon benefactor; the DC for the breath is the higher of your class DC or spell DC. The potion becomes inert if not used by your next daily preparations, so it has no value if sold.</p><table class=\"pf2-table\"><thead><tr><th>Dragon</th><th>Effect (Save)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Forest</td><td>Insects dealing piercing damage in a @Template[cone|distance:15] (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell])</td></tr><tr><td>Sea</td><td>Water dealing bludgeoning damage in a @Template[line|distance:30] (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell])</td></tr><tr><td>Sky</td><td>Lightning dealing electricity damage in a @Template[line|distance:30] (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell])</td></tr><tr><td>Sovereign</td><td>A psychic roar dealing mental damage in a @Template[cone|distance:15] (@Check[will|against:class-spell])</td></tr><tr><td>Underworld</td><td>Flames that deal fire damage in a @Template[cone|distance:15] (@Check[reflex|against:class-spell])</td></tr></tbody></table>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 13
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "heavenscribe kobold heritage"
              },
              {
                "value": "expert in Crafting"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide"
          },
          "rules": [],
